    "date": "2026-08-25T20:31:46Z",
    "text": "Improving Coordination and Access to Resources Equitably for Youth Act or the Improving CARE for Youth Act\n\nThis bill prohibits state Medicaid programs from denying coverage for primary care, substance use disorder, and mental health services that are furnished on the same day at the same office, clinic, or other outpatient facility (including via telehealth).\u00a0"
